### 🔀 DECISION POINT
> **🔀 DECISION POINT**: [Situation]
> ```
> IF [finding/condition A]:
>   → [Action A]
> IF [finding/condition B]:
>   → [Action B]
> IF unable to proceed safely:
>   → [Bailout option]
> ```

